staurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","review_id":"YJhz1odfYv908itAF_ydXQ","date":"2019-11-01T00:23:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941025972366333,"text_excerpt":"I am fan of this place. walking down bourbon street you'll notice a lot of the little willie chicken places and they all do have the same meals, and look the same. but this place caught my eyes for a few reasons. one it didn't smell so much like booze or funky smell. the chicken combo was great. fried chicken with fries and a sweet biscuit. can't go wrong with it. I had the thigh and drum stick, very tasty and juicy. cheap meal on the go. so you need to try this spot out. so my friends keep it tasty and let me know what you think."},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","review_id":"817jgOCoyAbVyeKOra_QEw","date":"2019-07-28T21:22:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9395219087600708,"text_excerpt":"There must be four outlets of Willies in the French Quarter. I of course go to the one thats basically in the center of it all on Bourbon Street. On Bourbon Street late on a Saturday afternoon service can be hit or miss, but we caught a lull so we were served quickly and took a seat to wair for the order to come up. Got a simple four-piece with some fries and a biscuit. The chicken came out fingerprint burning off hot so we had to wait a bit for it to cool off so it could actually be picked up (not an issue). Once I got to taste it, the chicken was phenomenal. Salty, spicy, juicy with an assortment of sauces on the table at the ready. Fries were good. The only downside was the biscuit tha..."},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","review_id":"RrNF2o7Uj7vp-ER1jhGe_Q","date":"2021-08-07T15:19:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.936650276184082,"text_excerpt":"Chicken was good! Fun place to stop. Cool place on Bourbon Street! Plenty of drink options to choose from. Friendly staff. Would come back again !"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","photo_id":"p9jaC5KDbMgPnni0S9gy8g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/p9jaC5KDbMgPnni0S9gy8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9012889266014099},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","photo_id":"85X11My-suDJcxrlXI2HYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/85X11My-suDJcxrlXI2HYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8663241863250732},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","photo_id":"YgsXTkNPtJKOaZ5PtS1lLQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YgsXTkNPtJKOaZ5PtS1lLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.862330436706543},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","photo_id":"xW6d7vui-j8sJfYby6ko2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xW6d7vui-j8sJfYby6ko2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8044537901878357},{"business_id":"J-HTokql9wMNBON6xyKLpg","photo_id":"eEppWdO8EcmBoaXg7jor3A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eEppWdO8EcmBoaXg7jor3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7828283905982971}]},"notebook_case":null